 Invest Your Ki. Keep Your Progress!\r\n\r\nYou no longer need to have enough Max Ki to fully unlock a Talent before investing in it!\r\n\r\n- **Invest ANY amount of Max Ki** toward unlocking a Talent, even if you can't afford the full cost yet.\r\n- **Your Talent progress is saved permanently!** Every bit of Ki you invest brings you closer to your next upgrade.\r\n- **Leaving the game?** Don't let your hard-earned Ki go to waste! Invest it in your Talents and keep building your power across play sessions.\r\n\r\nEvery bit of Ki counts now!\r\n\r\n## :performing_arts: 5 New Skins!\r\n\r\nTime to change your look!\r\n\r\n- **4 brand-new Character Skins** to bring more personality to your destruction!\r\n- **1 new Power Skin** to unleash your abilities in a whole new style!\r\n\r\n## :earth_africa: World & Multiplayer Improvements\r\n\r\n- **Player Names:** You can now see other players' names above their heads when you get close to them. No more guessing who's who!\r\n- **Improved Healing Shards:** Healing Shards from red-leafed trees are now bigger and fall to the ground when the tree is destroyed, making them much easier to spot and collect.\r\n\r\n## :wrench: Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- **Host Migration Fix:** Fixed an issue where powers, Invader PODs, and shards could become permanently frozen in the world after the room switched hosts.\r\n- **Terrain Visual Fix:** Fixed a visual bug that made solid terrain walls appear to have holes in them.\r\n\r\n**Jump back in, try the new skins, and start turning every bit of Ki into permanent progress!**\r\n\r\nAnd as always, have fun destroying the world", "created_date": 1794383009, "id": "1457594217435614", "version": "0.0.8", "version_code": 22, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "bin